<section class="section">
  <p class="kicker mono">Swag</p>
  <h2>El cubo se toca. No se disfraza.</h2>
  <p class="note">
    Stickers, parche, pin, badge de batch, tote, remera, tapa de laptop.
    Sal y sombra. Nada naranja, nada de partner impreso en el cubo.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top: 0">
  <p class="kicker mono">Stickers</p>
  <div class="merch-row">
    <figure class="merch-card">
      <div class="merch-stage">
        <div class="sticker-round disc-only">
          <div class="disc">
            <img src="/logos/byc-b-sello-sombra.svg" alt="" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figcaption>Redondo · cubo B</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure class="merch-card">
      <div class="merch-stage">
        <div class="sticker-pill">
          <img src="/logos/byc.svg" alt="BYC" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <figcaption>Píldora · lockup</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure class="merch-card">
      <div class="merch-stage">
        <div class="sticker-die">
          <img src="/logos/byc.svg" alt="BYC" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <figcaption>Troquel · tres cubos</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <div class="merch-row" style="margin-top: 1.1rem">
    <figure class="merch-card wide">
      <div class="merch-stage sheet">
        <div class="sticker-sheet">
          <span class="mini"><img src="/logos/byc-b-sello.svg" alt="B" /></span>
          <span class="mini"><img src="/logos/byc-y-sello.svg" alt="Y" /></span>
          <span class="mini"><img src="/logos/byc-c-sello.svg" alt="C" /></span>
          <span class="mini round"><img src="/logos/byc-b-sello-sombra.svg" alt="" /></span>
          <span class="mini pill"><img src="/logos/byc-sello.svg" alt="BYC" /></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figcaption>Plancha · B Y C sueltos + sello</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="salt section">
  <p class="kicker mono">Batch</p>
  <h2>Pin, parche, credencial.</h2>
  <div class="merch-row">
    <figure class="merch-card on-sal">
      <div class="merch-stage light">
        <div class="pin">
          <img src="/logos/byc-b-sello-sombra.svg" alt="Cubo B" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <figcaption>Pin · cubo B</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure class="merch-card on-sal">
      <div class="merch-stage light">
        <div class="patch">
          <img src="/logos/byc-b-sello-sombra.svg" alt="" />
          <span class="mono">BATCH 01</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figcaption>Parche · bordado</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure class="merch-card on-sal">
      <div class="merch-stage light lanyard-stage">
        <div class="lanyard-strap"></div>
        <article class="piece badge">
          <img class="lock" src="/logos/byc.svg" alt="BYC" />
          <div class="who">
            <p class="mono" style="color: var(--tinta)">BATCH 01</p>
            <strong>Ana R.</strong>
            <p>founder · La Paz</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <figcaption>Badge · lanyard</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <p class="kicker mono">Prendas y objetos</p>
  <div class="merch-row objects">
    <figure class="merch-card">
      <div class="merch-stage tall">
        <div class="tote">
          <span class="handle a"></span>
          <span class="handle b"></span>
          <div class="tote-body">
            <img src="/logos/byc.svg" alt="BYC" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figcaption>Tote · lockup sobre sal</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure class="merch-card">
      <div class="merch-stage tall">
        <div class="tee-mock">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 200 220" aria-hidden="true">
            <path
              fill="#161b24"
              d="M62 22L100 32L138 22L200 62L168 84V220H32V84L0 62Z"></path>
          </svg>
          <img src="/logos/byc-b-sello-sombra.svg" alt="" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <figcaption>Remera · cubo B al pecho</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure class="merch-card">
      <div class="merch-stage tall">
        <div class="laptop">
          <div class="lid">
            <img src="/logos/byc-b-sello-sombra.svg" alt="" />
          </div>
          <div class="base"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figcaption>Laptop · cubo B</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="salt section">
  <p class="kicker mono">Papel</p>
  <div class="merch-row">
    <figure class="merch-card on-sal">
      <div class="merch-stage light">
        <article class="piece cert">
          <p class="mono" style="color: var(--tinta)">BY-COMBINATOR</p>
          <img class="lock" src="/logos/byc.svg" alt="BYC" />
          <h2>Completó el Batch 01.</h2>
          <p>Once semanas. Sin equity. La mesa, no el hall.</p>
          <p class="mono" style="color: var(--tinta); margin-top: 1rem">
            La Paz · 2026
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <figcaption>Certificado · print</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
  <p class="note" style="margin-top: 1.4rem">
    El cubo no se bordéa de neón ni se estampa a todo color. Si el objeto es
    oscuro, cubos de sal. Si es claro, cubos de sombra.
  </p>
</section>
